   "source": [
    "# Byte-pair Encoding\n",
    "\n",
    "1) Start with character-level tokenization\n",
    "2) Find most frequent token pair in a sequence with order\n",
    "3) Merge them into new token and preserve previous\n",
    "4) Repeat until we fill whole vocabulary"
   ]
